   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>, with the same face, hairstyle and clothing throughout. Her voice: a young Chinese woman around twenty-three, clear and warm with a slightly lower, relaxed tone, confident and friendly like a lifestyle vlogger, standard Mandarin, easy natural pace. No audio reference is used; the voice is generated from this description only.\nsummary:\nOne continuous portrait shot with a fixed camera and steady soft indoor lighting. S1 speaks to camera in three connected passages, without any pause or reset between them. Keep the same background and framing throughout. No scene cut, no subtitles, no improvised dialogue.\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet steady room tone throughout. Only the three quoted Mandarin lines are spoken, once each, in a natural conversational pace. No music.",
    "During 00:00.000–00:10.790, S1 looks at the camera and starts speaking naturally: <d>[Mandarin]大家好，我今天想跟你聊一件特别小的事。就是我们到底要不要慢下来这一件事，真的还挺重要的。</d> This is the ONLY text she says in this interval: she speaks exactly these characters once, at a natural conversational pace, and finishes them before the interval ends. If she finishes early, she closes her lips and stays silent with a calm expression. She never adds any other words, never speaks English, never improvises.\nDuring 00:10.790–00:21.458, Still looking at the camera without any pause or posture reset, S1 continues speaking: <d>[Mandarin]我们每天都在赶时间，好像慢一秒就会被这个世界远远落下。可你有没有发现，其实真的不是这样。</d> This is the ONLY text she says in this interval: she speaks exactly these characters once, at a natural conversational pace, and finishes them before the interval ends. If she finishes early, she closes her lips and stays silent with a calm expression. She never adds any other words, never speaks English, never improvises.",
